/*!
  \page example_cxx_fit_line_page Line fitting

  This example fits a line with Ponca::CovarianceLineFit to random 3D samples distributed along a line. The fitted
  line (Ponca::Line, a specialization of `Eigen::ParametrizedLine`) is the line of largest variance of the samples,
  and its potential is the squared distance to the line.

  Build and run:
  \code{.sh}
  cmake --build build --target ponca_fit_line
  ./build/examples/cpp/ponca_fit_line
  \endcode

  \include cpp/ponca_fit_line.cpp
*/
